<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῑλό-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bareness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>baldness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				27
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>smoothness,</i> of a woman's body, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.651a
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραχύτης,</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				979a
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασύτης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				499a11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tenuity</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιλός</span> VI.
				<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>), opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασύτης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1456b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the spiritus lenis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.47.10
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
